00:24.580 --> 00:25.780
No agkararag kayo,

00:26.840 --> 00:27.840
kas to itikunayo.

00:27.840 --> 00:33.900
Amami, maday-dayaw kumati na santuan anagan mo.

00:35.100 --> 00:36.520
Umay kumati pagariham,

00:37.640 --> 00:41.200
Itad mo kadakami titaraon amasapol mi itiinaldaw.

00:42.640 --> 00:45.040
Pakawanin na kami kadagiti basbasol mi,

00:45.860 --> 00:49.340
